  "prefLabel": "He-C 210.02 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 210.02 Purpose. These rules implement RSA 21-G:37, V, by:\n\n(a) Setting forth the circumstances under which the provisions of RSA 21-G:37 II – IV shall be waived by the department; and\n\n(b) Establishing the circumstances constituting an emergency or loss of funding under RSA 21-G:37, V.\n\nSource. #12051, eff 11-19-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c200.html"
